          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in hybrid attacks (cyber, sabotage) increases counterparty and operational risk in payment, settlement and repo systems, prompting lenders to pull back and increasing margin calls and haircuts, thereby elevating funding-market stress." />
