          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An uptick in hybrid attacks (drones, sabotage, cyber on ports and shipping) in the Russia–Europe context spreads techniques, matériel flows, and permissive norms that enable similar attacks on commercial shipping in the Gulf and Strait of Hormuz, directly degrading export-route security." />
