          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Worsening market forecasts of sustained supply disruption (e.g., energy shortages) push up expected inflation and growth shocks, leading investors to repriced the timing and magnitude of central bank tightening, raising policy rate expectations." />
