          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising market and stakeholder expectations of wider US–Iran escalation lead traders and refiners to lower their assessed likelihood of uninterrupted future supplies, reducing market expectations of available fuel supply." />
