          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A harder domestic political stance in the US and allied publics over the standoff drives policy-makers to broaden export controls and push for tighter multilateral limits on technologies that could be diverted to Iran, resulting in expanded formal restrictions affecting Chinese technology transfers and collaborations." />
