          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Hardening domestic political attitudes toward an adversary prompts governments and regulators to preemptively roll out emergency measures (inventory releases, price supports, export controls) to insulate domestic markets from anticipated spillovers." />
