          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger market expectations of near‑term rate hikes increase pressure on AI firms to hit revenue targets quickly (pricing, faster productization), which can shorten safety testing cycles and raise perceived systemic AI safety risk." />
