          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Markets pricing in higher policy rates in advanced economies increase perceived refinancing and balance‑sheet stress for China‑linked investments, which foreign regulators interpret as higher risk and therefore intensify security, transaction and investment scrutiny of Chinese actors." />
