          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Net inflows into fixed‑income and liquid vehicles free up allocable capital for venture and growth funds and reduce dry powder drawdowns, so a drop in investor liquidity directly forces managers to cut new AI investments and an increase directly enables more deal‑making." />
